  "notes": [
    "R4 (LR-FIX-B2) — the prior receipt's matrix-390-zh-* crops were byte-identical to their EN twins because setPrefs in smoke.cjs and cap.cjs called Playwright's addInitScript(script, T, L) with TWO positional args. Playwright's addInitScript signature is addInitScript(script, arg?), so the script's L parameter was undefined, localStorage.setItem('lang', undefined) coerced to the STRING 'undefined', the boot inline script stamped data-lang='undefined' on <html>, and the panel's isZh() returned false. The fix is a one-liner in both files: pass a single object and destructure inside. Acceptance is checked per ZH crop in `r4_zh_acceptance` and per crop in `pngs[].lang_facts`. The page's langchange re-render still has a stale-listEl bug in the template, so setLang is not called in capture paths — the boot inline script at templates/sector_central.html.j2 L20 is what sets data-lang from localStorage.",
    "B2 NEW SYNTH variants: groupsnull (hostile groups=[null] triggers render()'s groupsOk guard → mr-invalid), estimate (measured_read.research_estimate={status:estimate, probability:0.62, horizon_sessions:21} renders the 'Research estimate — display only: 62% over the next 21 sessions.' line), basisunknown (measured_read.generation.price_basis='unknown' → basis() returns 'basis not stated' / '未注明价格口径'). Marked synthetic in VARIANTS.json and the per-PNG record.",
    "setTheme/setLang are NOT called in capture paths because the page's panel re-render on `langchange` has a stale listEl reference bug (bodyEl.innerHTML is reset to GRID_HTML, but the IIFE's listEl/unEl references still point to the detached originals, so the re-populated list is invisible). The addInitScript pre-populates localStorage, and the page's boot inline script sets data-theme/data-lang from it. setTheme/setLang existence and attribute-setting are verified in a separate assertion (PASS).",
    "All §4 assertions PASS at this change (4a deep_link_XLK, 4b click_back_fwd, 4c keyboard dark+light, 4d segbtn_space, 4e-A42 hfailed list+msg, 4f touch_44px row/seg/link all ≥44, 4g-A39/A40 runtime_purity, setThemeLang attrs)."
  ]
